WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
LavaGoal Choose a panel. Preview its path. Play your court.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Start with your court. My court > Free play opens an untimed setup.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Same position. High bounce. Repeatable physical trial with Middle selected.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Change only the angle. Middle remains selected. Compare Low bounce.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Move the panel to Defend. Position changes the court you will play on.

6
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Move the panel to Attack. Three positions and two angles are available.

7
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:49.400
Drive, double-jump, boost. Actual input in untimed practice on the selected court.

8
00:00:49.400 --> 00:01:00.400
Apply it in High hoop. A playable challenge, followed by its actual completion.

9
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:06.200
Nine rivals across three cups. Win matches to unlock the next rival.

10
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:11.200
Earn colours and patterns. Gameplay requirements are shown. No extra purchase.

11
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.200
Play a match on your court. Normal gameplay from the installed release build.

12
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:23.200
See the scoring play again. Actual goal replay from this court.

13
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:30.000
Try the mechanic yourself. English > My court > Free play. No account required.

